Package: uu-remote-for-linux-wayland
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Wenqi Guo <129141646+GuoWQ222@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: uu-remote-for-linux (= @VERSION@), base-files (>= 13ubuntu10), base-files (<< 13ubuntu11~), gnome-shell (>= 46~), gnome-shell (<< 47~), xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, gir1.2-mutter-14 (>= @MUTTER_VERSION@), libmutter-14-0 (>= @MUTTER_VERSION@), mutter-common (>= @MUTTER_VERSION@), mutter-common-bin (>= @MUTTER_VERSION@)
Description: UU Remote for Linux Ubuntu 24.04 GNOME Wayland profile
 Installs the shared UU Remote runtime and the verified Noble amd64 Mutter
 screen-cast latency repair from one offline ZIP in one normal APT transaction.
 A logout and new GNOME Wayland login are required after Mutter changes.
